      ],
      "title": "梦幻的夜空·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34717001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "终于到了决胜的时候了，小玛莉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "穗香，我们一起——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "「天使ATTACK」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "「小恶魔扣杀」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "在「天使与小恶魔」队的合力击打下，海怪停止了活动。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "已经……结束了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "好好休息吧，我会照顾你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哎，这次度假真是见到了不得了的东西啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "以后和小结月见面可有的吹了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "好累……只有我感觉还很不舒服吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔……好吵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "发生什么事了？为什么大家看上去都灰头土脸的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717013",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "原来这家伙之前一直在睡觉吗？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "别高兴得太早。\n事情还没完，它还没有消失。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "海怪的身体还在颤动……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "岛主，趁现在快把画面拍下来。\n或许可以作为宣传片的珍贵素材呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "……那是不是有点恐怖了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧，先记录下来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……等下，相机去哪里了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "诶？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "在另一边——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "因为我的海巫术还在起作用，所以它无法就这样消失。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……它会维持着濒死的状态，永远地在生死的境界间徘徊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "那我们该怎么办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你们的抵抗帮我取回了术式的控制权，我会承担起最后的责任——结束它的痛苦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "（古老的语言）还乡吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "再找找，肯定是刚才混乱的时候落在哪里了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我再往靠海的位置找找看……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "找到了！但是躺在水坑里……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "看上去已经完全进水了，还能开机吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34717032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "呜……我们录的假期素材……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-823",
