      "title": "梦幻的夜空·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34719001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "咻——嘭！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嘿嘿，手持烟花燃烧起来真好看呢~\n在晚上看上去就像彩色的棉花糖一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "感觉目光已经完全被火花吸进去了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "噶哈哈哈，手持烟花只是小孩子玩的。\n本王要玩就玩大号的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "唔，说什么呢，玛莉可不是小孩子！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "咻——嘭！啪啦啪啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "真是梦幻般的夜晚……让我想起北阿罗拉的庆典之夜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "这是即使用画笔，也不一定能够描绘的美丽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哇塞，这颗烟花炸得真大！\n葵别睡了，错过了可就没机会了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "……知道了，我会躺在沙滩上好好看的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719011",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "咻——啪啦啪啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "别拦着我，我要用这些二踢脚把月亮给轰下来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "停停，阳子姐你太过兴奋了啦！啊……危险！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "text": "轰——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "贝歌小姐……和弗吉尼娅小姐，你们不来参加烟花大会吗？\n大家都在沙滩上了呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "不，我只需要待在这里——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "她说可以。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "那么你呢，弗吉尼娅？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我们走吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……直到现在，我才发现转瞬即逝的烟花是这样美丽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719021",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "时间就这样愉快地流逝——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……花了一番功夫也只找到了一台旧相机。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "裁判小狐",
          "text": "啊，这货又要来拍宣传片了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "岛主，大家都在等你了哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "啊，岛主~挑战赛已经变得非常，非常热闹了呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "岛主快看~将玛莉和穗香的烟花合在一起……是不是很漂亮？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "……|101|。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719028",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "虽然可能是错觉，半人鱼似乎朝这边露出了微笑。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这次不拍宣传片了，只是简单地拍个合照吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719030",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "3，2，1……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719031",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "咔嚓——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34719032",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "梦幻的假期在眼前如此定格。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-825",
