    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34720001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……快醒……快醒醒……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……我又睡着了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……想起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……看完烟花后，我在玛莉和穗香的身边睡着了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "主人，你醒了！\n快递已经送到门口了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "感觉有点头晕……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "糟糕，这该怎么办……还记得我是谁吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "34720009",
              "text": "不记得了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "34720009",
              "text": "你是仓田家的……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "34720008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "呜……我是仓田真乃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……刚才的是梦？我睡了多久了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "主人在桌上睡了快一个下午呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我现在去取快递。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "箱子里面是主人网购的新手办吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，是人气很高的玛莉萝丝和穗香。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……是因为这个才做的梦吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "怎么了，主人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没什么，现在要开箱了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "她们看上去真漂亮呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……和梦里的真像。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "等下，她们已经活化了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720023",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "玛莉和穗香相视一笑，随后将目光转向自己。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "好久不见，岛主~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玛莉萝丝",
          "text": "有没有兴趣，和玛莉许下一个约定？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720026",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "假期真实与否并不重要——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34720027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "重要的是留下了珍贵的回忆。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
